Subject: [PATCH] ==== vaddr: support probes ====

Test
====

I confirmed it can capture ~47 mb working set of masim in vaddr mode,
like below.

First, start masim [1] to access ~47 mb memory at a time, in background.

    $ ./masim/masim ./masim/configs/stairs-50mb.cfg --repeat 10 --quiet &

Note that the config says the working set is 50mb.  It is is 50 million
bytes, so ~47.68 MiB.

Start traditional access monitoring of masim's virtual address space
using damo [2].

    $ sudo ./damo/damo start $(pidof masim)

Confirm it can capture the 47 MiB working set.

    $ sudo ./damo report access
