Stop access monitoring and start probe-only mode access monitoring.

    $ sudo ./damo stop
    $ sudo ./damo start $(pidof masim) \
            --probe_prep set_pgidle --probe_filter allow pgidle_unset \
            --probe_weight 1

Confirm it can also capture the ~47 MiB working set.

    $ sudo ./damo report attrs
